## 🔧 **Configuration**

### **config.py** - Complete Configuration Reference

```python
# config.py

# --- Streaming Settings ---
DEFAULT_RTMP_URL = "rtmp://localhost/live"
DEFAULT_STREAM_KEY = "your-stream-key-here"
FPS = 30
MAX_STREAM_KEY_LENGTH = 30

# --- Window Settings ---
DEFAULT_WINDOW_WIDTH = 1200
DEFAULT_WINDOW_HEIGHT = 800

# --- Audio Settings ---
AUDIO_SAMPLE_RATE = 44100
AUDIO_CHANNELS = 2
AUDIO_BUFFER = 512

# --- AR Effects Settings ---
SMILE_THRESHOLD = 3.2
EYEBROW_THRESHOLD = 7.0
NOSE_THRESHOLD = 0.45
MOVEMENT_TIMEOUT = 3.0

# --- UI Settings ---
APPEARANCE_MODE = "dark"  # "dark", "light", "system"
COLOR_THEME = "blue"     # "blue", "green", "dark-blue"
```

