## 🚨 **Troubleshooting**

### **Common Issues & Solutions**

<table>
  <tr>
    <th>❌ Issue</th>
    <th>🔧 Solution</th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><b>FFmpeg not found</b></td>
    <td>Download from <a href="https://ffmpeg.org/download.html">ffmpeg.org</a> and place in project folder or add to PATH</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><b>Camera not working</b></td>
    <td>Check camera permissions, try different camera index (change <code>cv2.VideoCapture(0)</code> to <code>1</code>)</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><b>No audio from video</b></td>
    <td>Ensure FFmpeg is installed for audio extraction, or use MP3 files directly</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><b>Black screen on video</b></td>
    <td>Check video codec support (H.264 recommended), convert video using FFmpeg</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><b>Streaming fails</b></td>
    <td>Verify RTMP URL and Stream Key are correct, check internet connection</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><b>MediaPipe import error</b></td>
    <td>Install <code>mediapipe==0.10.7</code> or use <code>cvzone</code> fallback</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><b>High CPU usage</b></td>
    <td>Reduce video resolution, lower FPS, close background applications</td>
  </tr>
</table>

